ating it. A well-made rug should not only enhance your décor but also offer lasting durability and comfort.<\/p><p>At Indian Rug Store, we take pride in preserving the timeless art of handmade rug weaving. Our collection features beautifully crafted rugs made by skilled artisans across India, blending traditional techniques with contemporary designs. Each rug is thoughtfully handcrafted, carrying its own unique character and story. Explore our range of weaving styles, materials, and craftsmanship to discover the perfect rug that complements your space and reflects your personal style.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_rHRFTN","text_3M7tye"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":["p {text-align: center;}"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"desktop_content_position":"center","content_alignment":"center","heading_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":0}},"card_text_F8CFbT":{"type":"card-text","blocks":{"image_card_NeRUrJ":{"type":"image_card","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/GENERATE_A_BANNER_OF_THIS_202606171601.jpg","title":"Hand-Knotted","title_color_override":"#000000"}},"image_card_bhewnU":{"type":"image_card","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/GENERATE_A_BANNER_OF_THIS_202606171602.jpg","title":"Hand-Tufted","title_color_override":"#000000"}},"image_card_VjDQyJ":{"type":"image_card","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/GENERATE_A_BANNER_OF_THIS_202606171606.jpg","title":"Hand-Loom","title_color_override":"#000000"}},"image_card_qdepCa":{"type":"image_card","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/GENERATE_A_BANNER_OF_THIS_202606171610.jpg","title":"Flat Weave","title_color_override":"#000000"}}},"block_order":["image_card_NeRUrJ","image_card_bhewnU","image_card_VjDQyJ","image_card_qdepCa"],"disabled":true,"custom_css":["h3 {text-align: center;}",".custom-image-grid-section {padding: 0px 20px;}",".image-card img {border-radius: 0px;}",".image-grid {row-gap: 15px; 